      {
        "subquestion_id": "a7.SCHW",
        "label": "fact",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Schwab's CEO Wurster stated the retail business is built to win across generations, and that Schwab is well positioned to continue serving future generations when wealth is passed on, with an extremely high retention rate around wealth transfers.",
            "quote": "Our retail business is built to win across generations, wealth tiers, investing styles and engagement preferences. ... we are well positioned to continue serving future generations when that wealth is passed on. Our retention rate around wealth transfers is extremely high, and we are winning assets with all generations.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2026-09-30",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2026Q3#11"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab reports that approximately 75% of assets are retained in a wealth transfer event, and that roughly 80% of retail assets are held by ultra-high net worth and high net worth households.",
            "quote": "RETAIN ~75% Assets Retained in a Wealth Transfer Event 3",
            "value": "~75%",
            "unit": "assets retained in a wealth transfer event",
            "period": "",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-DECK-2026Q3#24"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab states that building deeper, longer-lasting relationships and retaining trusted relationships into the decades to come is why it is investing in both people and technology, including financial consultants and wealth advisors.",
            "quote": "That is why we are investing in both people and technology so we can continue building, deepening and retaining those trusted relationships now and for the decades to come.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2026-09-30",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2026Q3#12"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab acquired Wealth.com and rolled out AI-powered estate planning tools to clients, enhancing tax, trust and estate capabilities as part of its wealth offer.",
            "quote": "We also increased our strategic investment in Wealth.com, which we are already using to bring AI-powered estate planning tools to our clients.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2026-03-31",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2026Q1#7"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab is expanding its branch footprint and hiring hundreds of financial consultants and wealth consultants to deepen relationships with higher net worth retail clients and their families.",
            "quote": "We're expanding our branch footprint and hiring hundreds of financial consultants and wealth consultants to deepen relationships with our higher net worth retail clients and their families.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2025-03-31",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2025Q1#12"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab's CEO stated it will open branches to capture the migration of wealth and reposition some branches, and expects to grow roughly 250 new financial and wealth consultants during 2025, continuing in 2026 and 2027.",
            "quote": "That's a reflection of the importance of the role, the migration of wealth to different parts of the country... We expect to grow roughly 250 new financial and wealth consultants during the year... You'll continue to see us invest in this in 2026 and 2027",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2025-03-31",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2025Q1#44"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Schwab is enhancing its tax, trust and estate capabilities, including plans to offer wealth.com's estate planning tools to retail clients, as part of its wealth business investments.",
            "quote": "We are enhancing our tax trust and estate capabilities, including plans to offer wealth.com's estate planning tools to our retail clients.",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "2025-06-30",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "SCHW-TR-2025Q2#12"
            ]
          }
        ],
